From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:34:21 +1100
Subject: Apply Little Trainer rules to battles

Guaranteed catching, free Poke Balls, full heal after battle, boosted and
party-wide experience, no PP use, player attacks never miss, no enemy
critical hits, damage scaling, automatic move replacement and no money
loss on defeat. All gated by LT_Rules() and never active in link battles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

